@HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Kubernetes Learning Endpoint - Get Pod & Node Info
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/info
Accept: application/json

### 2. Kubernetes Liveness Probe
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. Kubernetes Readiness Probe
GET {{HostAddress}}/ready
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get All Employees
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/employees
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Employee by ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/employees/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Create New Employee
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarah Connor",
  "email": "sarah.connor@contoso.com",
  "department": "Security Operations"
}

### 7. Update Employee
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Johnson",
  "email": "alice.j@contoso.com",
  "department": "Principal Cloud Architect"
}

### 8. Delete Employee
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/employees/4

### 9. Validation Error Test (Invalid Email)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "not-a-valid-email",
  "department": "IT"
}
